window.products.push({"id":348024,"name":"Oliven 3 Pcs Red Christmas Bedding Santa Claus Duvet Cover Twin Size Elk Quilt Cover Snowmen Xmas Bed Cover with 2 Standard Pillowcases for Christmas ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81u5qCXlOsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🌲Important Note： NO STUFFING inside the christmas duvet cover(not include any comforter or filling) Christmas quilt cover just has hidden zipper closure,not include 4 corner ties. You can put your own comforter, duvet or blanket into the cover, just COVER. :) Xmas bed cover pattern has 2 identical sides, the opposite side and the front side of the quilt cover have the same santa claus and elk pattern,so as to be closer to the skin. 🌲Size Information： Twin Xmas Duvet Cover Set：1 Duvet Cover 172x218cm (68\"x86\") + 2 Pillow Cases 51x66cm (20\"x26\") Queen Xmas Duvet Cover Set：1 Duvet Cover 228x228cm (90\"x90\") + 2 Pillow Cases 51x66cm (20\"x26\") King Xmas Duvet Cover Set：1 Duvet Cover 228x264cm (90\"x104\") + 2 Pillow Cases 51x91cm (20\"x36\") 🌲Duvet Cover： Christmas duvet cover is a protective layer that slips over the duvet and has a closure. Because duvets and comforters can be expensive and difficult to clean, christmas duvet covers are used for protect your comforter,easily removed and easy to wash. You can also quickly and easily change the look of your bed and room without having to completely redecorate. The duvet cover also allows you to change your style or color of your bedding with the simple switch of the cover. 🌲HOW TO USE THE DUVET COVER： 🎅 1- Lay the comforter flat. 🎅 2- Insert your hands inside and find the two top corners. holding one corner in each hand. 🎅 3- With your hands inside the duvet cover, reach down to grab hold of the comforter’s top two corners. 🎅 4- Holding the top two corners tightly, give it a shake and a fluff until the duvet cover falls down to cover most of the comforter. 🎅 5- Stuff the bottom two corners of the comforter inside the bottom two corners of the duvet cover. Zip it up at last. 🎅 6-Have fun and enjoy your Christmas holiday!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81u5qCXlOsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Oliven","source_asin":"B0817W1H4T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-348024","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0817W1H4T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0817W1H4T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
