window.products.push({"id":348145,"name":"XHXSTORE 4 Bundles Faux Fern Plants Bushes Outdoor Small Artificial Ferns Plants Plastic Faux Greenery Shrubs for Outside Spring Garden Patio Hanging ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71eHsOy+-HL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Product description: The realistic appearance and proper branching of plastic ferns make it easier for you to use them to your liking. Add a touch of green and texture to bouquets, wedding center decorations, mantels, shelves and coffee table arrangements. You can also put it in vases, hanging baskets, and flower beds to be inspired by nature. Or hanging on the ceiling, balcony, wall, it is a great decoration for corridors, open air, restaurants, offices, and wedding bouquets. Material: plastic Color: green Dimensions: The stem is 15.7 inches long and the expanded width is 9.1 inches. Packing: 4pcs * 7 forks persian grass green Tip: 1. Do not put artificial plants in water or sunlight for a long time, otherwise it will affect the color of plants. 2. If there is dust, clean it with a wet towel or sprayer and let it air dry. 3. When transporting, each bunch of plants is tightly closed to reduce space. You can fiddle with the branches to adapt to the most natural state. 4. The above dimensions are measured manually, there may be slight differences, please refer to the actual product. 5. The plant is made of plastic, because it is sealed in the package, there will be a peculiar smell, just open it for a while. 6. Because the color of the monitor is still different from the actual product, there may be a certain color difference.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71eHsOy+-HL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"XHXSTORE","source_asin":"B085DSPGYJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-348145","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B085DSPGYJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B085DSPGYJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
