window.products.push({"id":348242,"name":"Smartblinds Motorized Zebra Blinds Works with Alexa, Blackout Day and Night Dual Layer Sheer Shades Blinds Customized Size, Privacy Light Control Hori","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":159.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pbJGHgZXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Excellent Material】90% blackout, alternating sheer and waterproof solid fabric combination. Adjust light by slats dislocation, flexibly switch between privacy and light filtering.【Upgrated Accessories】Our blinds have been upgraded to have a sturdier bottom rail to prevent the fabric from fraying, which makes the two layers of fabrics more closely fit, maximizing the effect of shading. An anti-collision strip installed under the rail can protect your window frame. 【3 Battery Motors】Durable quality battery rechargeable motor, each full charge can work for about 3-5 months. ❶[R140] Stardard Battery Motor can only be controlled by a remote control and mobile phone via \"Tuya\" App. ➋[R145] Smart Battery Motor needs a hub (included) to connect to Alexa and Google Assistant. ➌[Zigbee Battery Motor] Needs a hub (included) to connect to Alexa and Google Assistant. [R140] and [R145] can pair a solar panel (not included), no need to worry about the charging issue. 【R301】Hardwired Smart Motor can directly work with Alexa and Google Assistant via the \"Tuya\" App. No Hub Required. Need to be plugged in all the time. 【REMOTE CONTROL】We provide a remote control for free (Batteries are included). You can also order a RF timing remote, which can help you open or close the blinds at specific times. One remote or RF timing remote can control 6 power shades separately and simultaneously. 【LEAD TIME】Dispatch in 3-5 working days after getting size confirmation. 5-8 working days for transportation. Click \"Customize Now\" to order your own blinds and then we will send an email within 24 hours to confirm order information and recommend optimum size for you. Order will be proceed without any adjustment if we don't get any reply in 48 hours. 【Our Service】Smartblinds offers a 2-year warranty on all our motors and remote controls, during which we will repair/replace them free of charge. Each remote control blind is made to order, can't be sold after a return. We appreciate customer precise measurement & careful order, avoid return without quality issue. Please contact us if there is any problem and we will help solve it until you are satisfied.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pbJGHgZXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"smartblinds","source_asin":"B0BBG43GM8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-348242","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BBG43GM8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BBG43GM8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":348243,"name":"MyFrameStore Silver 8x12 Imperial Wooden Picture Frames – Antique Color | Exclusive Floral Design for Wedding, Hallway, Bedroom, Living Room & Office ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.24,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/918eJyDucEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ADD A TOUCH OF ELEGANCE TO YOUR DÉ COR WITH A TIMELESS 8x10 ANTIQUE DESIGN IMPERIAL PICTURE FRAME. THIS GORGEOUS SOLID WOOD FRAME FEATURES A MAJESTIC FLORAL DESIGN THATS A WARM AND CLASSIS DÉ COR TO ANY HOME. Features: - Color: Silver. - Material: Wood. - Usage: Antique design gold wood frames to showcase your most cherished moments. An excellent gift for a wedding, housewarming, anniversaries and so much more. Our multi-display wooden photo frames perfectly fit just about anywhere in your space, beautifully. Why Imperial Photo Frames?Display in a Variety of Ways: This is a brand new 8 by 12 picture/photo frame (meaning an 8-inch by 12-inch or a 12-inch by 8-inch print will fit just right). Solid wood 1. 375-inch wide and 1-inch thick molding with a 0. 25-inch deep rabbet is covered with a thin layer of gesso and painted antique-silver. It also features protruding floral design touched with patina. One of our oldest designs; available in a few colors, each still popular, already as a vintage-style. This silver variation is smooth and gentle enough to make a design point in the room, yet not attract more attention than the picture itself. Works amazingly with black-and-whites and those old sepia landscapes. Worthy frame for your most dear certificate, diploma, photograph, artwork, craft project, etc. , wherever you chose to hang it: office, living room, hallway, bedroom, or even kitchen of any style and size. Makes a nice Easter gift. Protect Your Memories: Keep your photos and prints safe from scratches, dents, fading and other damages with the Imperial photo frames. A splendid frame & gorgeous match to the most pretentious interior for a fraction of market price. Look no further. This frame will stay in your house for years to come, reminding of special days in a most elegant way, instantly shifting your home towards those wealthy, old-world Victorian houses.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/918eJyDucEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MyFrameStore","source_asin":"B000FZ0K96","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-348243","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000FZ0K96","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000FZ0K96","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":348244,"name":"The Last Supper Leonardo da Vinci 4.5\"x1.5\" Panoramic Refrigerator Magnet","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":5.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZTPrnueoL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This is a beautiful refrigerator magnet depicting Leonardo da Vinci's famous painting \"The Last Supper.\" This is a wide, \"panoramic\" magnet and is approximately 4.5\"x1.5\". This would be a great gift or personal item for the da Vinci fan or lover of classic artwork. About Our Fridge Magnets Our fridge magnets feature a deluxe \"wrap-around\" metal shell construction with a full, strong magnetic back. Unlike flimsy vinyl or \"magnetic paper\" magnets, ours will hold multiple sheets of paper securely to your fridge. We use a premium-quality printing process for crisp, vivid artwork that you will love looking at. Similar metal magnets use a loose, reflective Mylar sheet on the front of the image; we use an ultra-clear, semi-gloss bonded film which provides stunning clarity when viewed from any angle, as well as enhanced durability. They are the type of fridge magnets you would expect to find in a fine gift shop or boutique. We are sure you will be proud to give them as gifts or treasure them yourself for years to come.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZTPrnueoL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Classical Creations","source_asin":"B003SPMAP2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-348244","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003SPMAP2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003SPMAP2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
