window.products.push({"id":348294,"name":"ROLIZOE Bath Mat Light Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jft9gLRfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💗INCREDIBLY THICK & SOFT💗 - Compared with most thin bath mats in the market, our upgraded thickness and density absolutely bring you the heavenly experience while stepping on it after a bath at every time. Made of high-quality microfiber, this soft and fluffy cloud will perfectly pamper your feet and make sure your toes sunk into comfortable contentment. 💗NON SLIP BATHROOM RUG💗 - It is worth mentioning that we upgrade the ordinary TPR rubber backing to non-toxic TPE, which will be more anti-slip, scratch-resistant and durable. Premium TPE backing touches better and can withstand frequent machine washing. Ingenious and professional grooves of the bottom increase its friction and make the bathroom mat more stable, protecting your family from slipping or falling. Suitable for any bathroom floor. 💗EXCELLENT WATER ABSORBENCY💗 - High-density microfibers make it absorb every drop of water from your feet while you’re stepping out of the bath, shower, spa, or getting ready by the sink, keeping your feet warm and cosy. The moisture will be trapped in the deep pile, allowing the soft bath mat to dry quickly and cleanly. 💗DURABLE & EASY TO CARE💗 - Every fiber is firmly fixed on the base so that frees you from shedding issues. With the reinforced fiber-locking technology and well-made edge, our shaggy bathroom rug is durable and still maintain its performance after multiple times of machine washing and drying. No degumming, no off-line, no discolouration and no deformation. Machine wash on cold, then lightly tumble dry on low heat. 💗VERSATILITY💗 - Multiple modest solid colors and sizes can easily coordinate with bathrooms in different styles. Suitable for use as a home floor mat, living room mat, bedroom mat, front or back door mat, laundry mat, living room mat, office mat, bathtub rug, threshold rug, washroom mat, and so on. Great gift for all occasions, Christmas, Wedding, Father's Day, Mother's Day, Valentine's Day, etc. Take the cloud to your home early!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jft9gLRfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ROLIZOE","source_asin":"B09CPY113L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-348294","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09CPY113L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09CPY113L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
