window.products.push({"id":348583,"name":"Black Pearl Mug (16 ounce)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91KkTvIp23L._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Black Pearl handmade pottery mug  DETAILS - Three sizes available - 12 ounce, 16 ounce, 20 ounce - Black and pearlized glossy glaze - Extremely durable and chip resistant - Handle does not get hot when warmed in the microwave - Perfect for everyday use - Microwave safe - Dishwasher safe - Made from white stoneware clay - Food safe  HOW IT'S MADE - Wheel-thrown on the potter's wheel - Individually glazed, making each one unique and wonderful in it's own way - Kiln fired 2x - Once for it's bisque fire, ready for glazing, Second for it's glaze fire (2,167 degrees fahrenheit)  MY PROCESS Interested in learning more about my process? You can see some behind-the-scenes footage on my Instagram page here: https://www.instagram.com/turtlerok/  WHAT IT'S NOT - Not made with molds - Not mass-produced ware - Not stove-top safe (or any direct heat/flame)  TurtleRok produces the highest quality handmade coffee mugs at our studio located in Bradenton, Florida. Our passion for making the best handmade coffee mugs and our commitment to customer service set us apart.  UNIQUE Slight imperfections are a part of handmade pottery and add character to the mugs I make. This is something that you cannot find in lifeless, factory made ceramic ware - but you knew that already, and that is why you are here! Each TurtleRok stoneware item is hand thrown on the potters wheel.   MADE TO BE USED Because our mugs are fired to such a high temperature, each coffee mug is extremely durable and chip resistant. The sturdy handles are very comfortable for holding a hot cup of tea or coffee. Should you reheat your coffee or tea in the microwave, the handle on the mug will not get hot under normal circumstances. No need to wash the mugs by hand - they have no problems going through the dishwasher.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91KkTvIp23L._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TurtleRok","source_asin":"B09BG3JS28","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-348583","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09BG3JS28","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09BG3JS28","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
