window.products.push({"id":348695,"name":"Veeool Portable Neck Fan, 4000mAh Battery Operated, Neck Fans Portable Rechargeable Cooling Fan, Personal fan Air Conditioner for Neck, Hands Free USB","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CRYblBd3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❄【Lightweight & Skin-Friendly】Are you still struggling with no free hands to hold fan to relieve hot flashes? Our portable fan can free your hands, made of soft silicone, only 0.44 lb, long time wearing our portable neck fan will not cause burden on your neck. ❄【Powerful Airflow & Low Noise】With 72 blades hidden inside the fan, easily relieve hot flashes in 3 seconds. Twin turbine brushless motor provides strong airflow and low noise. Personal fan around your neck, so the cool airflow reach your sweaty skin quickly without dissipating before it reaches your skin, cooler than other fans. ❄【Hands-free Design & Fashionable】Hand-free neck fan was designed as a headphone to free your hands anytime; The fashion style makes you look cool and you can take neck fans portable rechargeable anywhere in hot weather. ❄【Safe & Large Battery Capacity】Designed without fan wings, bladeless fan solves the problem of hair tangling, also safe for children and pets. USB fan built-in real 4000mAh lithium battery, running for 6-12 hours (depending on wind speed). 3 speed settings meet your different needs. ❄【360° Surrounding Wind】: Quiet and 360° powerful airflow cools your entire neck and face, comfortable without direct blowing. Our portable fan can be rotated flexibly 360°, allowing you to find the most suitable wind direction. What a smart choice for summer! ❄【Summer Gift】: The travel fan compatible with all USB output devices, can be used in various occasions such as hiking, camping, kitchen, housework, sports, office, etc. Take a lightweight cooling fan with you wherever you go, so you will not get sweaty and irritated. 👉Correct way of wearing: The air outlet of the fan should face upward.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CRYblBd3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Veeool","source_asin":"B0BZVVBQJM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-348695","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BZVVBQJM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BZVVBQJM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
