window.products.push({"id":348775,"name":"Isaac Jacobs 4” x 4” Clear Plain Acrylic Picture Frame, Magnetic Photo Frame, Made for Tabletop Display with Two-Way Easel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618i0bLFEvL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This Isaac Jacobs plain acrylic magnetic frame with a sturdy, clear two-way easel, puts your photographs beautifully on display. The frame combines a traditional look with modern 21st Century functionality. It’s an ideal choice to display the big moments in life like weddings, birthdays and first days of school. This frame can rest vertically or horizontally on any countertop, shelf, desk or dresser. Create the floating effect by using a smaller photo (with a tiny piece of clear tape) and make more fun in the frame. The detail on the clear acrylic frame’s edges accentuates the décor of any room you put it in. You’ll enjoy how easy it is to remove and replace photos! The strong magnets on the four corners of the panes seal the frame tightly. Replacing the photo of your child opening presents, with a vacation photo takes no effort. Document your child’s first haircut. Preserve your parents’ old thin mementos or switch them out for snapshots of moments that tell the story of the life you are building. It is easy to slide apart the acrylic panes and insert a new keepsake, document, or photo. It may spark your creativity and spur you to take more photos. The acrylic frame can easily be wiped clean with a cloth. The frame has both a classic and modern appeal and it makes an ideal gift choice for any occasion. We spend so much time flipping through images on screens all day. It feels good to see our memories and passions preserved in style. [NOTES: (1) Do not use glass cleaner on acrylic. (2) This frame cannot be mounted on a wall.]","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618i0bLFEvL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Isaac Jacobs International","source_asin":"B01DMPYJPG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-348775","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01DMPYJPG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01DMPYJPG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
