window.products.push({"id":348785,"name":"ABZUOON Countertop Wine Rack,Wine Rack with Glass Holder ,Wood Wine Bottle Holder Storage Rack Stand Perfect for Home Decor & Kitchen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713XrvkC5UL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Wood 【Best Quality and Rustic Style】 Metal & wood combine design is durable and looks perfect wine bottle holder and red wine glass holder. The frame is made of steel, black powder-coated process, oxidation resistant and rust-resistant. The thick wooden base at the top and bottom, the whole wine rack is stable and beautiful. 【Space Saving Design】The countertop wine rack has room for up to 6 standard bottles(Diameter less than 3.46inch) of your favorite wine. There is a small practical tray at the top, and some simple things (bottle openers and corks) make the whole wine rack more practical and rich. 【Embellish your life】2 in 1 wine cup holder. This is a stylish and simple countertop wine shelf stands. The ingenious hook design at the top can hold 2 wine glasses of various sizes. Pour yourself a glass of wine and enjoy some mindfulness after a long stressful day at work. 【Easy to Assemble】The wine and glass holder possess the assemble design,all the parts are inside the box.You will have a perfect countertop wine rack for you less than 10 minutes. 【Product Parameters】Size: 13.5''L x 6.3''W x 13.8''H. Please ensure if this wine holder rack can suit for the place you want to put.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713XrvkC5UL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ABZUOON","source_asin":"B08VS7JJZB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-348785","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08VS7JJZB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08VS7JJZB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":348786,"name":"Automatic Soap Dispenser Touchless - Stainless Steel - Black - hands free motion sensor - waterproof for bathroom or kitchen countertop - also other l","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Gtck6uGoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Stainless Steel Automatic Soap Dispenser Touchless with 3 adjustable levels and viewing window Our touchless soap dispenser can also be used for hand gel in kitchen, bathroom, or business. Great for encouraging children to wash! Less mess: No more trying to open or pump a soap container with dirty or food-covered hands. Simply place your hand under the spout and the infrared sensor will dispense the selected amount into your hand. The base sits up off the surface to prevent pooling of water underneath and the no-drip spout keeps the countertop tidy. Beautiful and practical: The stylish, black stainless steel shell adds an upscale touch to any decor. The easy-to-use refill cap opens and locks with a slight twist and the dispenser comes with a funnel for help with pouring from wide-mouth or heavy bottles. Viewing window lets you see how much liquid is left and when it's time to refill. Easy to set up and use: Twist bottom cover to insert batteries. Open the fill cap on top by twisting, pour in liquid and replace the cap. Press the On button. When first started, the dispenser is at level 2 (medium). Another press of the On button switches to level 3 (max), then level 1 (min). For refilling, travelling or storage, press the Off button. SPECIFICATIONS: Size: 8 x 4.3 x 3in (200 x 108 x 73mm)Weight: 12oz (340g)Capacity: 9.5oz (280ml)Color: BlackMaterial: 304 stainless steel shell, leakproof nylon inner containerSensor: infrared, distance 1.2-2in (3-5cm)Power: 4 AAA batteries (not included), DC 6V, housed in an IP65 waterproof compartmentIncludes: Soap dispenser, instructions, funnelWarranty: We offer an 18mo manufacturer warranty. If you are unhappy in any way, we will gladly make it right. Click the button above to buy now!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Gtck6uGoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jasper Cottage","source_asin":"B08F5LQN9B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-348786","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08F5LQN9B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08F5LQN9B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":348787,"name":"Round Armenian Ceramic Seder Plate with 6 Bowls, Colourful Grape Design, 30cm","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81SaOlm04kL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A unique, hand painted and glazed Seder plate with matching bowls that will make a striking impact on your Seder table and stay in your family for years. This beautiful ceramic design, brought to Israel by Armenian master craftsmen, has become one of the country's most distinctive styles. Each of the 6 sections of the plate and its associated bowl carries the word identifying the appropriate food in Hebrew and English. Zeroah (shank bone), Baytsah (roasted egg), Maror (bitter herb e.g. horseradish), Charoset (a sweet salad of apples, nuts, wine and cinnamon), Karpas (a green vegetable) and Chazeret (a second bitter herb, often Romaine lettuce). This Armenian ceramic plate also carries the Hebrew word Pesach (Passover) in the centre, surrounded with a classic Armenian design. Each individual item is hand made, fired, then hand painted using metallic and oxidised paint in order to keep its natural colour. It is then finished with a fine glaze that gives it its attractive appearance before being re-fired to harden the glaze. Easy to clean. Suitable for dishwashers. Plate Diameter: 30cm Height: 2.5cm Bowls Diameter: 9cm Height: 2cm","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81SaOlm04kL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Armenian Ceramics","source_asin":"B00BIJ7QAE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-348787","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BIJ7QAE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00BIJ7QAE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
