window.products.push({"id":348846,"name":"iClanda Kitchen Thermometer, Digital Meat Cooking Thermometer for Candy Grill, Instant Read Magnet Waterproof Thermometer with Backlight Calibration &","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712o1TcUNfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Accurate Reading in 2~4 Seconds: iclanda digital meat thermometer for grilling is engineered with advanced sensing technology that provides an accurate temperature reading to ±0.9°F (±0.5°C) within 3 seconds. It features a wide temperature range of 32°F to 572°F (-50°C - 300°C) to measure any food you want. Easy to Read: iclanda digital meat thermometer boasts a 1.4-inch clear display with bright backlight which gives you a clear view even in dim or dark conditions. The display rotates (like a smartphone) so you can always read it easily without having to crane your neck. Calibration & Reset: iclanda thermometers are individually calibrated for extra reassurance. Besides, the reset function help return to the factory setting if you have difficulty in calibration. Enjoy consistent accuracy when testing beef, roast chicken thighs, a whole chicken, milk, candy, bread, beer, etc. Ultra-long Stainless Steel Probe: The 4.76in/121mm long probe of iclanda cooking thermometer means you don’t need to get too close to the heat on a grill. Hold function can also lock the current temperature for 10s, never worry about burning your fingers! Waterproof & Easy to Store: The waterproof design means iclanda meat thermometer can be washed easily, making it easy for daily maintenance. Protective sheath, hanging hole and built-in magnet provide you multiple mounting options. You can always keep it clean and tidy. Low battery reminder & 10min auto shut-off function provide maximum convenience and longer lifespan.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712o1TcUNfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"iclanda","source_asin":"B08S338294","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-348846","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08S338294","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08S338294","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":348847,"name":"Howarmer Soft Plush Mongolian Faux Fur 20-Inch-by-20-Inch Throw Pillow Cover, Aqua Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1veK1cHs0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Howarmer Cotton Decorative Throw Pillow Cover Set of 2----- Mongolian Faux Fur,---Color: Purple,Coral,Pink,Blue,Teal,Yellow -----Sizes:18\" X 18\", 45 x 45 cm/20 X 20\",50 X 50 cm,/20 X 12\",50 X 30cm------Design pattern is only on the front side,Back side is the assortment color with front Side","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1veK1cHs0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Howarmer","source_asin":"B01MRJOIQO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-348847","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MRJOIQO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MRJOIQO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":348848,"name":"Heuck Pre-Seasoned Cast-Iron 3-Piece Skillet Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/419LYdVUWTL._AC_.jpg","description":"Don't just purchase a piece of cookware purchase cast iron cookware that will last for generations. Pancakes, eggs, bacon, casseroles, cakes and pies somehow taste better when cooked in heavy pre-seasoned cast-iron cookware. Cast iron creates superior heat retention, heats evenly, and loves a campfire, unlike flimsier pans. Great for preparing slow cooked meals, and perfect for searing meats that then can go directly into oven to finish cooking. Due to the great heat retention of cast iron, it will keep your food warm longer than any other cookware. Pre-seasoned out of the box saves you time and helps with easy cleanup. USE & CARE: Before first use, Pre-seasoned cast iron cookware should be washed in hot soapy water using a soft sponge or dishcloth. Pans should then be rinsed and dried. Do not allow your cookware to air dry or put away wet. Completely hand dry cookware before storing. Use mild liquid soap for this first preparation only. Before cooking, preheat the empty pan over medium heat for 1 – 2 minutes: preheating prepares the surface and allows the food to cook more evenly without sticking. Repeat before each use. This product can be used on all cooking surfaces as well as in the oven but please make sure that you lift the cookware to move across glass or ceramic surfaces. The cover to your cast iron cookware is oven safe to 350°F and the cooking vessel is safe to 500°F. Do not use under a broiler or in a microwave oven. Always use hot pads to remove cookware from stovetop or oven. This cookware is heavy - please handle with care. Clean your cookware after each use. To clean, wipe the pan with a soft sponge or dishcloth in hot water and rinse; do not use detergents, because they will remove the seasoning. Never put cast iron cookware in the dishwasher. Make sure that you thoroughly dry before storing; this can be done by wiping the pan dry, then heating the pan on the stove for a few minutes and then allowing it to cool. TO PREVENT RUSTING: always wash by hand, dry thoroughly, do not put in the dishwasher or use detergents. FOR BEST RESULTS: Re-season your cookware regularly: To season the pan, coat the entire surface of the pan (inside and outside) with any kind of vegetable oil, spray, or melted solid shortening. Use a cloth or paper towel to spread the oil. Heat your oven to 300°F and place the pan inside for about one hour. Remove the pan from the oven while still hot and place it on the stove to cool. Wipe away any excess oil and store when cool.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/419LYdVUWTL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Heuck","source_asin":"B000VP9GQI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-348848","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000VP9GQI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000VP9GQI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":348849,"name":"FITLAND Kitchen Scale, Rechargeable Digital Food Scale 22lb 1g/0.05oz Precise Graduation Tempered Glass Scale for Cooking Baking, LCD Display, Hook De","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ahllgSJNL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"【USB Rechargeable】this digital kitchen scale uses only a rechargeable lithium battery as the power supply.Use rechargeable lithium batteries, reduce the use of disposable batteries, more convenient and more environmentally friendly. 【Accurate Measurement】The scale for food ounces and grams is equipped with 4 high precision load sensors, 22lb capacity, 5 unit conversions(g, oz, lb: oz, fl’oz, ml), and can measure up to 10kg of items in 1g increments., 1.9 x 1 inch large and bright LCD display for easy reading. 【Tare Function】The food scale for weight loss has a tare button,which is easy to zero for weighing any grain, vegetable, milk in container when baking and cooking. 【Durable glass platform】The kitchen food scale has a 4mm waterproof tempered glass panel, more durable, using wet cloth easy to clean any debris and spills on the scale. Please don't wash the whole scale in water to prevent kitchen weight scale from malfunction. 【Practical Design】The food weight scale is 8.5\" x 6.1 \"size, with hook holes for easy storage. This multifunction scale has low battery power display function, overload displayfunction, the function of automatic power off in 1 minutes.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ahllgSJNL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FITLAND","source_asin":"B08Z3JTMQK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-348849","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08Z3JTMQK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08Z3JTMQK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
