window.products.push({"id":348865,"name":"French Press Coffee Maker (34 oz)- Stainless Steel lid - 3 Level Filtration System with 1 Extra Filter,Heat Resistant Thickened Borosilicate Glass,No ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Pzc+8zLZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"If flavor really matters to you - With this French Press, you can consistently brew exceptional coffee that suits your taste. It’s up to you. Control the grind size and the length of steeping time. You can decide for yourself how bold and flavorful your coffee will be. Use our French Press for a richer and more intense flavor. A good day starts with real coffee. Easy to use -Just add some ground coffee and water to the French press coffee maker, put the cover back and wait for a few minutes, push it down, and then you could enjoy your fresh coffee. This French Press is a perfect gift for friends or family members who are coffee or tea lovers. Specifications: Capacity: 1000ml, 34oz - 8 cups Material: The inner layer is made of Borosilicate Glass, the outer layer is 304 stainless steel. Dimension: 3.1inch (D) x 8.6 inch（H） Color: Green, Purple Packaging List: 1 x French Press Coffee Maker Safety Reminder: 1. Keep away from children when hot to avoid burns! 2. Using excessive force can cause scalding liquid to shoot out of the pot. 3. Do not use on an induction cooker.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Pzc+8zLZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SUNNOW","source_asin":"B098Q2XMDQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-348865","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B098Q2XMDQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B098Q2XMDQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
