window.products.push({"id":348929,"name":"They Called Her A Liar- Justice Denied in the Tawana Brawley Case","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":5.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51CgGbqP7WL._AC_.jpg","description":"NEW! Non-fiction work which revisits the unresolved case of the 1987 abduction and 3-day disappearance of fifteen year old Tawana Brawley in Wappingers Falls, NY. She was found in a plastic garbage bag unconscious and smeared with feces and KKK written on her chest. She reported being pulled into a car by a 'white cop\". A nine-month Grand Jury investigation concluded that she had perpetrated a hoax and lied about the incident . The book revisits the facts of the case, as provided to the public, journalistic citations and available documents and statements of some witnesses which seem to indicate that there was no hoax. She had not lied. She had been kidnapped and abused over a period of time by a group of white men and left for dead. The words on the cover of the book are images of her writing on the evening she was found as she tried, unable to talk, to tell her story. \"White Cop\", \"woods\" \"I don't know\" \"first\" \"a lot\" The author suggests that release of investigative files and grand jury testimony currently held by the New York State Attorney General's Office would shed additional light on the controversy and allow the burden of being labeled a liar, accompanied by a defamation judgment to be lifted from the shoulders of now adult Tawana Brawley.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51CgGbqP7WL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Roots & Wings Publications","source_asin":"0990952010","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-348929","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/0990952010","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"0990952010","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
