window.products.push({"id":348949,"name":"overstockArt Renoir Dance in the Country with Opulent Frame Oil Painting, Dark Stained Wood with Gold Trim","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":264.34,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81cImtSW86L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Originally painted in 1883, \"Dance in the Country\" by Pierre-Auguste Renoir now sits in the MusÃe d'Orsay in Paris. It's an important work from Renoir's career for a number of reasons. Most importantly, the work became a symbol of his eventual break from Impressionism. He was inspired by the works of Raphael and began experimenting with a more classical style here. Another reason the painting is historically significant is that the female dancer, Aline Charigot, would later become Van Gogh's wife. With stunning beauty and a romantic backstory, this oil painting reproduction of Van Gogh's \"Dance in the Country\" would be a lovely addition to any home. The soft colors and classical styling easily fit in with existing décor. Frame Description: Opulent Frame From the Manufacturer OverstockArt is an art manufacturer of framed hand painted oil reproductions and canvas art prints. overstockArt was among the earliest online galleries of hand painted oil paintings and the first to focus on art reproductions of great masters such as Van Gogh, Monet and Klimt. From Impressionist art to Modern Art, overstockArt has the perfect framed canvas art for your home. At overstockArt, we live and breathe the oil paintings that surround us and feel we have a special connection with our customers. Put simply, we are art lovers serving art lovers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81cImtSW86L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"overstockArt","source_asin":"B07SVZVG7F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-348949","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07SVZVG7F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07SVZVG7F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
